    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d933">

                <pb facs="0727" n="611" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg611"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/13531.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Carothers to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guadalupe</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-10-18T18:00:00-06:41">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 18, 1914, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>General Villa authorized me this afternoon to inform Department of State that he
                    will support any provisional president that may be selected by the Convention
                    except Carranza.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carothers</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
